{"summary":"Solve the mysteries of the universe with potato power!","description":"Major new update! \n\nSPACEPLAN is an experimental piece of interaction based partly on a total misunderstanding of Stephen Hawking’s A Brief History of Time. Use manual clicks and the passage of time to create and launch potato-based devices and probes from your nondescript satellite orbiting a mysterious planet. Unlock the mysteries of the galaxy or just kill some time in what the astrophysics community is calling the ‘best narrative sci-fi clicker game of all times’.\n\nFEATURES\n\n* Fifteen starchy items to unlock, create, and blast into the vacuum of space.\n\n* Life affirming, silly story that will both captivate and help you kill time.\n\n* Reveal the secrets of five different planets across two different realities.\n\n* Banging soundtrack, as is customary in a narrative sci-fi clicker game.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":null,"header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gNwXeYiNyNebyv1oFGyshIs_9oBTNmpgrTIT6Gh-15ifivaPfHdRGEIxorgafrxS3fWb7Tt-lipvCKCaIKM3","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Y93AXaaKP104MAikPK7Tqp6ZWKCVSM1wSVaXZ2A376nSYLdFv7OMdCNzWE9zIknj76A_uwskGnZ_D0fKejeEWD0","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DOsS8wJHcD9wTD5CmlhYB5lm3D9BXQziCF2abY9oMCZOJ83_E2BsRTnxJTkxpkm1KLFKNT9nOGpDgI4VqcwdKQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a7IZZDms8hww2Prsd7FoD8jDaVggtHXAH1p16UEFBCaQQUfvi88Pf1kZo-ZbisdjsrdLS3A7hHDUCivApgbAPg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OOGQncoJcLAaWvWi9G_lbc5QJEeG8D2G1_ytk6_-3XUxNIca4EcPCUxHpbXz-eefyQNA_Nvyz3_RLB616yV4f-Q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GOsybFmHUMzXMQc0io_SL4DTjzYhnrmnWc5i0ED0WpaE08Lm-BL1NNllS6QPDUOPw_Pc-_c6-LKac9Nqho_nYA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uQyK8cpeZHFwc9pK1InWbPsHOM6Cs9dQvSNiR8-ZX5stpuYrbpOmEG2e8J3VqGsAGPiLNELRJBiF0Og5_wL5yw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5YKVU4DzM1VcDi2LtdYzY9XIVde1NbnpIm7xkb-WtgwZJXbPQATQlFvHSuY4aqYBQq3G_qeaODllrIL-uhBH","htt